<title>NORWAY: Kvaerner wins Indonesian pulp deal.</title>
<headline>Kvaerner wins Indonesian pulp deal.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kvaerner ASA said on Friday it had signed a letter of intent for delivery of recovery and power boiler equipment worth around 340-375 million crowns to the Musi pulp project in Indonesia.</p>
</text>
